{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018LAgcafrtCbvirS1cX6QTi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t/bin/bash: line 1: cd: kits: No such file or directory\n2\t/* =====================================================================================\n3\t * SLICE 22  SPORTS  (Sensible Soccer, NBA Jam, Tecmo Bowl).\n4\t * Two against two in a walled cage, for up to four players: the GULLS against the RUST, two halves on the clock, a\n5\t * golden goal if it ends level. The ball is a Body: it rolls, bounces off the ground and the boards, and curls.\n6\t * KEYS: the stick runs; J passes (to the teammate the stick points at, led to where it is going), L lobs one over a\n7\t * defender (its arc solved by E.arc to land at the teammate's feet), K held fills the shot meter and shoots on letting go\n8\t * (the stick across the goal aims it; pushed sideways just after, it curls: aftertouch). Without the ball: J slides in\n9\t * to tackle, K switches to the teammate nearer the ball. TOUCH: the stick, PASS, SHOOT (hold), LOB.\n10\t * PLAYERS: MATCH is you against the CPU; VERSUS lets players 2 to 4 in (2 on the keyboard, or Start on a pad): player 2\n11\t * takes the RUST, 3 and 4 the second of each side. The rest are run by formation: with the ball, the other one runs\n12\t * ahead on the far side; without it, the nearer presses and the other covers the goal. Commentary on Dialog's radio.\n13\t * Deep links: #sports/match (a match against the CPU), #sports/vs (VERSUS: players 2 to 4 join).\n14\t * HOW IT WORKS: a TileMap cage (boards that cut low before the camera, nets), the ball and the players as E.Body, rigs\n15\t * that kick and slide (E.Attack), E.arc for the lob, game.allowJoin for players; SPORTS.run(n) is the proof,\n16\t * SPORTS.bot() plays a match through to its whistle and then a short one with four players.\n17\t * ===================================================================================== */\n18\tconst SPORTS = (() => {\n19\t  const A = game.audio, T = 16, FW = 36, FH = 22, ND = 2, GOAL = 5, BAR = 28, HALF = 60, GOLDEN = 45, PI = Math.PI;\n20\t  /* ---- THE CAGE: a field of FW x FH tiles inside boards (cut low where they hide it), a goal in each end with its net,\n21\t   * a stand of three tiers behind the north boards; built from rows: # boards, N net, . the field, : the net's floor,\n22\t   * 1 2 3 the stand's tiers (back to front), , outside ---- */\n23\t  const STAND = 3, COLS = ND + FW + 2 + ND, ROWS = STAND + FH + 2, MID = FH / 2, goalRow = r => r > MID - GOAL / 2 && r <= MID + GOAL / 2;\n24\t  const rows = [];\n25\t  for (let R = 0; R < ROWS; R++) {\n26\t    let s = ''; const r = R - STAND;   // (the cage's own row)\n27\t    for (let c = 0; c < COLS; c++) {\n28\t      const field = c > ND && c <= ND + FW && r > 0 && r <= FH, endCol = c === ND || c === ND + FW + 1, net = (c < ND || c > ND + FW + 1);\n29\t      if (r < 0) s += c >= ND && c <= ND + FW + 1 ? String(R + 1) : ',';\n30\t      else if (field) s += '.';\n31\t      else if (endCol && r > 0 && r <= FH) s += goalRow(r) ? '.' : '#';\n32\t      else if ((r === 0 || r === FH + 1) && c >= ND && c <= ND + FW + 1) s += '#';\n33\t      else if (net && goalRow(r)) s += c === 0 || c === COLS - 1 ? 'N' : ':';\n34\t      else if (net && (goalRow(r + 1) || goalRow(r - 1))) s += 'N';\n35\t      else s += ',';\n36\t    }\n37\t    rows.push(s);\n38\t  }\n39\t  const X0 = (ND + 1) * T, X1 = (ND + 1 + FW) * T, Y0 = (STAND + 1) * T, Y1 = (STAND + FH + 1) * T, CX = (X0 + X1) / 2, CY = (Y0 + Y1) / 2, GH = GOAL * T / 2;\n40\t  // the pitch: mown stripes with the grass's own grain, painted lines a little worn (the halfway line, the centre circle,\n41\t  // an arc before each goal), the nets' shadow on their floor, tarmac outside\n42\t  const line = (x, y) => {\n43\t    const d = Math.hypot(x - CX, y - CY), ex = Math.min(Math.abs(x - X0), Math.abs(x - X1)), ey = Math.min(Math.abs(y - Y0), Math.abs(y - Y1));\n44\t    if (ex < 1.5 || ey < 1.5 || Math.abs(x - CX) < 1 || Math.abs(d - 48) < 1) return true;\n45\t    for (const gx of [X0, X1]) if (Math.abs(Math.hypot(x - gx, y - CY) - 72) < 1 && Math.abs(x - gx) < 72) return true;\n46\t    return false;\n47\t  };\n48\t  const floorTex = (x, y, tag) => {\n49\t    const n = E.hash2(Math.floor(x), Math.floor(y)) - .5, m = E.noise2(x * .06, y * .06) * .5;\n50\t    if (tag === 'net') { const mesh = Math.floor(x) % 4 === 0 || Math.floor(y) % 4 === 0; return mesh ? [30, 66, 36] : [44 + n * 10, 92 + n * 14, 50 + n * 10]; }\n51\t    if (tag === 'out') return [44 + n * 18, 42 + n * 18, 50 + n * 18];\n52\t    if (line(x, y)) { const w = 228 + n * 24 + m * 10; return [w, w + 4, w - 8]; }\n53\t    const k = Math.floor((x - X0) / 32) % 2 ? 1 : 0, g = (k ? 140 : 106) + n * 34 + m * 24;   // (a stripe mown each way: lighter, darker)\n54\t    return [g * .42, g, g * .46];\n55\t  };\n56\t  let map = null;\n57\t  const makeMap = () => new E.TileMap({ rows, legend: { '#': 1, N: 2, 1: 5, 2: 4, 3: 3, '.': { floor: 'grass' }, ':': { floor: 'net' }, ',': { floor: 'out' } }, floorTex, outside: '#1e1c24', ao: 4,\n58\t    types: { 1: { h: 26, cut: true, cutH: 6, face: 'plank', side: '#3a4a6a', top: '#d8dce8', line: '#2a3450' }, 2: { h: BAR + 4, face: 'none', side: '#b8bcc8', top: '#e0e4ec' },\n59\t      3: { h: 34, face: 'stone', side: '#5a5468', top: '#6a6478' }, 4: { h: 44, face: 'stone', side: '#4e4a5e', top: '#5e586e' }, 5: { h: 54, face: 'stone', side: '#44405a', top: '#544e66' } } });\n60\t  // the crowd: two on each tile of the stand, in their colors, bobbing; on a goal, those of the side that scored jump\n61\t  const CROWD = [];\n62\t  for (let R = 0; R < STAND; R++) for (let c = ND; c <= ND + FW + 1; c++) for (const dx of [4, 12]) {\n63\t    const h = E.hash2(c * 3 + dx, R * 7 + 1), side = h < .5 ? 0 : 1;\n64\t    CROWD.push({ x: c * T + dx, y: R * T + 9, z: [54, 44, 34][R], side, shirt: side ? ['#c8502a', '#e07040', '#a83a1a'][(h * 30 | 0) % 3] : ['#eef0f6', '#2a5ab8', '#8ab0f0'][(h * 30 | 0) % 3], skin: ['#e0b090', '#a87050', '#6a4028', '#f0c8a8'][(h * 50 | 0) % 4], ph: h * 9 });\n65\t  }\n66\t  /* ---- THE TEAMS: their colors, names and players; the ball ---- */\n67\t  const TEAMS = [\n68\t    { name: 'GULLS', colors: { cloth: '#eef0f6', pants: '#2a5ab8', boot: '#1e2030', belt: '#2a5ab8', trim: '#2a5ab8' }, chip: '#eef0f6', players: [['NOOR', '#3a2418', '#c89070'], ['BEX', '#e8c070', '#f0c8a8']] },\n69\t    { name: 'RUST', colors: { cloth: '#c8502a', pants: '#2a2a30', boot: '#1a1a1e', belt: '#1a1a1e', trim: '#e8c070' }, chip: '#c8502a', players: [['DRAGO', '#1e1c1a', '#a87050'], ['KIT', '#6a3a22', '#e0b090']] }];\n70\t  const SPEED = 92, AI_SPEED = 86, KICK_CD = .3;\n71\t  const BALL = E.sprite(['.www.', 'wwkww', 'wkkkw', 'wwkww', '.www.'], { w: '#f4f4f0', k: '#2a2a30' });\n72\t  const BALL2 = E.sprite(['.www.', 'wkwkw', 'wwwww', 'wkwkw', '.www.'], { w: '#f4f4f0', k: '#2a2a30' });\n73\t  const SOUNDS = {\n74\t    kick: { wave: 'noise', freq: 900, to: 200, dur: .07, vol: .3, filter: 'lowpass' }, thump: { wave: 'sine', freq: 120, to: 70, dur: .08, vol: .3 },\n75\t    whistle: { wave: 'square', freq: 2200, vib: [30, .05], dur: .32, vol: .14 }, post: { wave: 'triangle', freq: 1400, to: 1100, dur: .3, vol: .25 },\n76\t    crowd: { wave: 'noise', freq: 600, to: 900, dur: 1.4, vol: .18, filter: 'lowpass' }, slide: { wave: 'noise', freq: 400, to: 200, dur: .25, vol: .18 }\n77\t  };\n78\t  for (const [k, v] of Object.entries(SOUNDS)) A.define(k, v);\n79\t  const SONG = { bpm: 140, steps: 4, tracks: [   // the cage: a bright chant over a bouncing bass\n80\t    { wave: 'square', vol: .07, notes: 'E5 . E5 G5 . E5 D5 . | C5 . C5 E5 . C5 B4 . | A4 . C5 . E5 . A5 . | G5 - - . . . . .' },\n81\t    { wave: 'triangle', vol: .3, notes: 'C3 . G2 . C3 . G2 . | A2 . E2 . A2 . E2 . | F2 . C3 . F2 . C3 . | G2 . D3 . G2 . B2 .' },\n82\t    { wave: 'drums', vol: .1, notes: 'k . h . s . h k | k . h . s h h .' }] };\n83\t\n84\t  /* ---- THE STATE ---- */\n85\t  let mode = 'menu', vs = false, team = [], all = [], ball = null, owner = null, last = null, clock = 0, half = 1, score = [0, 0], kickT = 0, t = 0, scripted = false;\n86\t  let stats = null, curlT = 0, golden = false, restartBy = 0, over = false, kickHold = 0;   // kickHold: the kickoff's rule (the other side out of the circle) until the ball is played\n87\t  const menu = new E.Menu(game, ['MATCH', 'VERSUS (2-4 PLAYERS)', 'BACK'], { onPick: i => i === 2 ? game.go('title') : i === 1 ? versus() : start(false) });\n88\t  const after = new E.Menu(game, ['REMATCH', 'MENU'], { y: 150, onPick: i => i === 0 ? start(vs) : toMenu() });\n89\t  const talk = new E.Dialog(game, { lines: 2, place: 'bottom', border: '#e8c070' });   // (at the bottom: clear of the score and of the touch buttons)\n90\t  const VOICE = new E.Humanoid({ weapon: null, hat: 'band', colors: { cloth: '#3a3a4a', hair: '#5a3a2a', skin: '#e0b090', hat: '#2a2a30' } });\n91\t  const say = text => { if (!scripted) talk.say(text, { name: 'CAGE RADIO', auto: 2.2, modal: false, alpha: .8, portrait: VOICE, portraitOpts: { zoom: 3, turn: .4 } }); };\n92\t\n93\t  function toMenu() { mode = 'menu'; game.splitScreen(0); game.allowJoin(false); A.music('title'); menu.i = 0; }\n94\t  function versus() { vs = true; mode = 'join'; game.allowJoin({ max: 4 }); A.sfx('select'); }\n95\t  /** a match: the four on the pitch, the ball at the centre, the clock at 0; players: who holds which (the inputs) */\n96\t  function start(versus) {\n97\t    vs = versus; map = map || makeMap(); score = [0, 0]; clock = 0; half = 1; golden = false; over = false; owner = null; last = null;\n98\t    stats = { passes: 0, done: 0, shots: 0, lobs: 0, tackles: 0, goals: [], walls: 0, curled: 0 };\n99\t    all = []; team = [[], []];\n100\t    TEAMS.forEach((tm, s) => tm.players.forEach(([name, hair, skin], k) => {\n101\t      const b = new E.Body({ x: CX, y: CY, r: 5, friction: 0, gravity: 700 });\n102\t      const p = { side: s, k, name, body: b, rig: new E.Humanoid({ weapon: null, build: 'heroic', size: 1.05, hair: k ? 'spiky' : 'short', colors: Object.assign({ hair, skin }, tm.colors), speedRef: 80 }),\n103\t        input: null, facing: s ? PI : 0, kick: null, slide: 0, stun: 0, cool: 0, meter: 0, charging: false, cheer: 0 };\n104\t      team[s].push(p); all.push(p);\n105\t    }));\n106\t    // who holds whom: player 1 the GULLS' first (and, alone, whichever GULL is nearer the ball); in versus 2 the RUST, 3 and 4\n107\t    // the second of each side\n108\t    const P = game.players;\n109\t    team[0][0].input = P[0];\n110\t    if (vs) { if (P[1]) team[1][0].input = P[1]; if (P[2]) team[0][1].input = P[2]; if (P[3]) team[1][1].input = P[3]; }\n111\t    ball = new E.Body({ x: CX, y: CY, r: 3, friction: 0, bounce: .55, gravity: 600 }); ball.spin = 0; ball.roll = 0;\n112\t    kickoff(0); game.allowJoin(false); A.music(SONG); game.input.consumeAll();\n113\t    game.follow(ball, { z: 8, lead: 10 }); game.cam.smooth = .18; game.cam.bounds = v => map.bounds(v);\n114\t    say('THE GULLS AGAINST THE RUST IN THE CAGE. HERE WE GO!');\n115\t  }\n116\t  /** the formation's spots: kicking off (s kicks), or in play (a team's two by where the ball is and who has it) */\n117\t  const goalX = s => s ? X0 : X1;   // where side s shoots (the GULLS attack the right end)\n118\t  function kickoff(s) {\n119\t    owner = null; ball.x = CX; ball.y = CY; ball.z = 0; ball.onGround = true; ball.vx = ball.vy = ball.vz = 0; ball.spin = 0;\n120\t    for (const p of all) {\n121\t      const dir = p.side ? 1 : -1, b = p.body;\n122\t      b.x = p.side === s && p.k === 0 ? CX + dir * 8 : CX + dir * (p.k ? 150 : 60); b.y = p.side === s && p.k === 0 ? CY : CY + (p.k ? 40 : -40) * (p.side ? -1 : 1);\n123\t      b.vx = b.vy = 0; b.z = 0; p.facing = p.side ? PI : 0; p.kick = null; p.slide = 0; p.stun = 0; p.meter = 0; p.charging = false;\n124\t    }\n125\t    mode = 'kickoff'; kickT = 1; restartBy = s;\n126\t  }\n127\t  /** a player's spot in the formation now: with the ball (or near it), go for it; else, attacking, ahead on the far\n128\t   *  side; defending, between the ball and its own goal */\n129\t  function spot(p) {\n130\t    const s = p.side, mate = team[s][1 - p.k], dir = s ? -1 : 1, has = owner && owner.side === s;\n131\t    if (has) return [clamp(ball.x + dir * 90, X0 + 30, X1 - 30), CY + (ball.y < CY ? 60 : -60)];\n132\t    const own = goalX(1 - s), near = Math.hypot(p.body.x - ball.x, p.body.y - ball.y) <= Math.hypot(mate.body.x - ball.x, mate.body.y - ball.y);\n133\t    if (near) return [ball.x, ball.y];\n134\t    return [lerp(ball.x, own, .55), lerp(ball.y, CY, .5)];\n135\t  }\n136\t\n137\t  /* ---- THE BALL: owned (at its owner's feet), or loose: a Body that rolls, bounces off the ground and the boards and\n138\t   * curls by its spin; a goal, over the bar, out of the cage ---- */\n139\t  function ballStep(dt) {\n140\t    if (owner) {\n141\t      const b = owner.body, f = owner.facing; ball.x = b.x + Math.cos(f) * 7; ball.y = b.y + Math.sin(f) * 7; ball.z = 0; ball.onGround = true;\n142\t      ball.vx = b.vx; ball.vy = b.vy; ball.vz = 0; ball.roll += Math.hypot(b.vx, b.vy) * dt; return;\n143\t    }\n144\t    const vx0 = ball.vx, vy0 = ball.vy, sp = Math.hypot(ball.vx, ball.vy);\n145\t    if (ball.spin && sp > 20) { const k = ball.spin * dt; ball.vx += -vy0 / sp * k * sp; ball.vy += vx0 / sp * k * sp; ball.spin *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4); }   // curl: across its path\n146\t    if (ball.z <= .5) { const f = Math.exp(-dt * 1.1); ball.vx *= f; ball.vy *= f; }   // rolling slows it\n147\t    ball.update(dt, map);   // (the Body bounces off the boards and the ground by its bounce)\n148\t    if (ball.hitWall) { ball.spin = 0; stats.walls++; if (Math.hypot(vx0, vy0) > 60) A.sfx('thump'); }\n149\t    if (ball.bounced) A.sfx('thump');\n150\t    ball.roll += Math.hypot(ball.vx, ball.vy) * dt;\n151\t    // a goal: over the line between the posts and under the bar; over it, a goal kick; out of the cage, thrown back in\n152\t    for (const s of [0, 1]) {\n153\t      const gx = goalX(s), past = s ? ball.x < gx - 2 : ball.x > gx + 2;\n154\t      if (past && Math.abs(ball.y - CY) < GH && ball.z < BAR) return goal(s);\n155\t      if (past && (ball.z >= BAR || Math.abs(ball.y - CY) >= GH)) return restart(1 - s, s ? X0 + 24 : X1 - 24, CY, 'OVER THE BAR. A GOAL KICK');\n156\t    }\n157\t    if (ball.x < X0 - 40 || ball.x > X1 + 40 || ball.y < Y0 - 4 || ball.y > Y1 + 4) restart(last ? 1 - last.side : 0, clamp(ball.x, X0 + 12, X1 - 12), clamp(ball.y, Y0 + 12, Y1 - 12), 'OUT OF THE CAGE! THROWN BACK IN');\n158\t  }\n159\t  /** play goes on from (x, y) with the ball at the feet of side s's nearer player */\n160\t  function restart(s, x, y, line) {\n161\t    const p = team[s].slice().sort((a, b) => Math.hypot(a.body.x - x, a.body.y - y) - Math.hypot(b.body.x - x, b.body.y - y))[0];\n162\t    p.body.x = x - (s ? -8 : 8); p.body.y = y; p.facing = s ? PI : 0; owner = p; ball.spin = 0; A.sfx('whistle'); if (line) say(line);\n163\t  }\n164\t  function goal(s) {\n165\t    score[s]++; stats.goals.push([s, last ? last.name : '?', Math.round(clock)]); owner = null; mode = 'goal'; kickT = 2.4; restartBy = 1 - s;\n166\t    for (const p of team[s]) p.cheer = 2.4; game.shake(3); A.sfx('crowd'); A.sfx('whistle');\n167\t    P.sparks(ball.x, ball.y, 16, 16, null, { color: '#ffe08a' }); P.ring(ball.x, ball.y, 4, 34, '#fff6c0', .5);\n168\t    say(golden ? 'GOLDEN GOAL! ' + (last ? last.name : '') + ' WINS IT FOR THE ' + TEAMS[s].name + '!' : 'GOAL! ' + (last ? last.name + ' SCORES FOR THE ' : 'THE ') + TEAMS[s].name + '! ' + score[0] + ' - ' + score[1]);\n169\t    if (golden) { over = true; }\n170\t  }\n171\t\n172\t  /* ---- KICKS: a pass along the ground led to the teammate, a lob over by E.arc, a shot from the meter with aftertouch ---- */\n173\t  /** the teammate a pass goes to: the one the stick points at (within 70 degrees), else the other */\n174\t  const mateOf = p => team[p.side][1 - p.k];\n175\t  function pass(p) {\n176\t    const m = mateOf(p), b = p.body, d = Math.hypot(m.body.x - b.x, m.body.y - b.y), sp = clamp(d * 1.5 + 90, 150, 270), lead = d / sp;\n177\t    const tx = m.body.x + m.body.vx * lead * .8, ty = m.body.y + m.body.vy * lead * .8, a = Math.atan2(ty - b.y, tx - b.x);\n178\t    release(p, Math.cos(a) * sp, Math.sin(a) * sp, 0); stats.passes++; ball.to = m;\n179\t  }\n180\t  function lob(p) {\n181\t    const m = mateOf(p), lead = .55, tx = m.body.x + m.body.vx * lead, ty = m.body.y + m.body.vy * lead;\n182\t    const v = E.arc({ x: ball.x, y: ball.y, z: 0 }, { x: tx, y: ty, z: 0 }, ball.gravity, { apex: 30 });\n183\t    release(p, v.vx, v.vy, v.vz); stats.lobs++; stats.passes++; ball.to = m;\n184\t  }\n185\t  /** a shot: power from the meter (0..1), aimed across the goal mouth by the stick's up and down */\n186\t  function shoot(p, power, aimY) {\n187\t    const gx = goalX(p.side), gy = CY + clamp(aimY, -1, 1) * (GH - 6), b = p.body, a = Math.atan2(gy - b.y, gx - b.x), sp = 170 + power * 230;\n188\t    release(p, Math.cos(a) * sp, Math.sin(a) * sp, 30 + power * 95); stats.shots++; curlT = .4; ball.to = null; A.sfx('kick');\n189\t  }\n190\t  function release(p, vx, vy, vz) {\n191\t    owner = null; last = p; kickHold = 0; ball.vx = vx; ball.vy = vy; ball.vz = vz; ball.onGround = vz <= 0; ball.spin = 0; p.cool = KICK_CD; p.kick = new E.Attack('kick'); p.kick.start(); A.sfx('kick');\n192\t  }\n193\t  /** a slide tackle: a dash along its facing; whoever it meets with the ball loses it */\n194\t  function tackle(p) { p.slide = .35; p.kick = new E.Attack('sweep'); p.kick.start(); stats.tackles++; A.sfx('slide'); const b = p.body; b.vx = Math.cos(p.facing) * 170; b.vy = Math.sin(p.facing) * 170; }\n195\t\n196\t  /* ---- A PLAYER'S STEP: from its input (a human's) or its brain (the formation's), then its body and its rig ---- */\n197\t  function playerStep(p, dt) {\n198\t    const b = p.body; p.cool = Math.max(0, p.cool - dt); p.stun = Math.max(0, p.stun - dt); p.cheer = Math.max(0, p.cheer - dt);\n199\t    let mx = 0, my = 0;\n200\t    if (p.slide > 0) { p.slide -= dt; const f = Math.exp(-dt * 3); b.vx *= f; b.vy *= f; }\n201\t    else if (p.stun > 0 || mode !== 'play') { b.vx = approach(b.vx, 0, 600 * dt); b.vy = approach(b.vy, 0, 600 * dt); }\n202\t    else {\n203\t      const c = p.input ? human(p, dt) : brain(p, dt); mx = c.move[0]; my = c.move[1];\n204\t      const sp = p.input ? SPEED : AI_SPEED, m = Math.hypot(mx, my);\n205\t      b.vx = approach(b.vx, mx * sp, 900 * dt); b.vy = approach(b.vy, my * sp, 900 * dt);\n206\t      if (m > .2) p.facing = E.approachAng(p.facing, Math.atan2(my, mx), dt * (owner === p ? 9 : 14));\n207\t      act(p, c, dt);\n208\t    }\n209\t    b.update(dt, map);\n210\t    // the loose ball: whoever reaches it first takes it (not just after kicking it, nor a ball high in the air, and a fast one only\n211\t    // right at its feet)\n212\t    if (!owner && mode === 'play' && p.cool <= 0 && p.stun <= 0 && ball.z < 9 && Math.hypot(ball.x - b.x, ball.y - b.y) < (Math.hypot(ball.vx, ball.vy) > 210 ? 4.5 : 9)) {   // (a hard shot is hard to trap)\n213\t      owner = p; ball.spin = 0; if (ball.to === p && last && last.side === p.side) stats.done++; ball.to = null;\n214\t      if (p.slide > 0) p.slide = 0;\n215\t    }\n216\t    // a slide that meets the ball's holder knocks it loose\n217\t    if (p.slide > 0 && owner && owner.side !== p.side && Math.hypot(owner.body.x - b.x, owner.body.y - b.y) < 12) {\n218\t      const o = owner; owner = null; o.stun = .5; last = p; ball.vx = Math.cos(p.facing) * 120; ball.vy = Math.sin(p.facing) * 120; ball.vz = 40; ball.onGround = false; p.cool = .2; A.sfx('thump');\n219\t    }\n220\t    if (p.kick) { p.kick.update(dt); if (!p.kick.busy) p.kick = null; }\n221\t    p.rig.update(dt, { x: b.x, y: b.y, z: b.z, vx: b.vx, vy: b.vy, facing: p.facing, attack: p.kick && p.kick.state, hurt: p.stun > 0, pose: p.cheer > 0 ? 'cheer' : null, expr: p.cheer > 0 ? 'shout' : null });\n222\t  }\n223\t  /** what a human's input asks: the stick; pass, lob, the shot's meter (held), a tackle or a switch */\n224\t  function human(p, dt) {\n225\t    const I = p.input, mv = I.move(), c = { move: mv, pass: I.pressed('pass'), lob: I.pressed('lob'), shootHeld: I.down('shoot'), shootUp: I.released('shoot'), aim: mv[1] * (p.side ? -1 : 1) };\n226\t    if (c.pass) I.consume('pass'); if (c.lob) I.consume('lob');\n227\t    // aftertouch: just after a shot, the stick across its path curls the ball\n228\t    if (curlT > 0 && last === p && !owner) { const sp = Math.hypot(ball.vx, ball.vy) || 1, across = (mv[0] * -ball.vy + mv[1] * ball.vx) / sp; if (Math.abs(across) > .3) { ball.spin = clamp(ball.spin + across * 3.2 * dt, -1.6, 1.6); stats.curled++; } }\n229\t    return c;\n230\t  }\n231\t  /** the CPU's footballer: to its spot in the formation; with the ball, run at goal, pass when pressed, shoot in range */\n232\t  function brain(p, dt) {\n233\t    const b = p.body, c = { move: [0, 0], pass: false, lob: false, shootHeld: false, shootUp: false, aim: 0 }, s = p.side;\n234\t    if (owner === p) {\n235\t      const gx = goalX(s), dg = Math.hypot(gx - b.x, CY - b.y), foe = team[1 - s].find(o => Math.hypot(o.body.x - b.x, o.body.y - b.y) < 30 && Math.abs(E.angDiff(Math.atan2(o.body.y - b.y, o.body.x - b.x), p.facing)) < 1.2);\n236\t      const a = Math.atan2(CY - b.y, gx - b.x); c.move = [Math.cos(a), Math.sin(a)];\n237\t      const shot = (meter, aim) => { c.shootHeld = p.meter < meter; c.shootUp = !c.shootHeld; c.aim = b.y < CY ? aim : -aim; };   // (held until the meter is where it wants it)\n238\t      if (dg < 95 && p.cool <= 0) shot(.4, .45);   // close in: shoot, pressed or not\n239\t      else if (foe) { const m = mateOf(p), lane = team[1 - s].some(o => segDist(o.body, b, m.body) < 14); if (p.cool <= 0) { if (lane) c.lob = true; else c.pass = true; } else c.move = [Math.cos(a + 1.1), Math.sin(a + 1.1)]; }\n240\t      else if (dg < 160 && p.cool <= 0) shot(.55 + p.k * .2, .55);\n241\t      return c;\n242\t    }\n243\t    let [tx, ty] = spot(p);\n244\t    if (kickHold > 0 && s !== restartBy) { const cd = Math.hypot(tx - CX, ty - CY) || 1; if (cd < 56) { tx = CX + (tx - CX) / cd * 56; ty = CY + (ty - CY) / cd * 56; } }   // (the kickoff: out of the circle)\n245\t    const dx = tx - b.x, dy = ty - b.y, d = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\n246\t    if (d > 6) c.move = [dx / d, dy / d];\n247\t    // pressing the holder: slide in when close and in front of it\n248\t    if (owner && owner.side !== s && d < 18 && p.cool <= 0 && Math.hypot(owner.body.x - b.x, owner.body.y - b.y) < 16) c.pass = true;\n249\t    return c;\n250\t  }\n251\t  const segDist = (o, a, b) => { const vx = b.x - a.x, vy = b.y - a.y, l = vx * vx + vy * vy || 1, u = clamp(((o.x - a.x) * vx + (o.y - a.y) * vy) / l, 0, 1); return Math.hypot(a.x + vx * u - o.x, a.y + vy * u - o.y); };\n252\t  /** the buttons: with the ball, pass, lob or the shot's meter; without it, a tackle (pass) or a switch (shoot) */\n253\t  function act(p, c, dt) {\n254\t    if (owner === p) {\n255\t      if (c.pass && p.cool <= 0) return pass(p);\n256\t      if (c.lob && p.cool <= 0) return lob(p);\n257\t      if (c.shootHeld) { p.charging = true; p.meter = Math.min(1, p.meter + dt * 1.25); }\n258\t      else if (p.charging && (c.shootUp || !c.shootHeld)) { p.charging = false; shoot(p, p.meter, c.aim); p.meter = 0; }\n259\t      return;\n260\t    }\n261\t    p.charging = false; p.meter = 0;\n262\t    if (c.pass && p.cool <= 0 && p.slide <= 0 && !(kickHold > 0 && p.side !== restartBy)) tackle(p);\n263\t    else if (c.shootUp && p.input && !vs) swap(p);\n264\t  }\n265\t  /** player 1 alone holds whichever GULL is nearer the ball when the other side has it (or K switches) */\n266\t  function swap(p) { const m = mateOf(p); if (m.input) return; m.input = p.input; p.input = null; }\n267\t  function autoSwitch() {\n268\t    if (vs) return;\n269\t    const s = 0, cur = team[s].find(p => p.input), m = cur && mateOf(cur);\n270\t    if (!cur || !m || m.input) return;\n271\t    if (owner === m || (ball.to === m) || ((!owner || owner.side !== s) && Math.hypot(m.body.x - ball.x, m.body.y - ball.y) + 24 < Math.hypot(cur.body.x - ball.x, cur.body.y - ball.y))) swap(cur);\n272\t  }\n273\t\n274\t  /* ---- A STEP OF THE MATCH: the clock, the halves, golden goal, the whistle ---- */\n275\t  function update(dt) {\n276\t    t += dt;\n277\t    if (mode === 'menu') { if (!menu.update(dt)) pickOnStart(menu); return; }\n278\t    if (mode === 'join') {\n279\t      if (game.input.pressed('start') || game.input.pressed('confirm')) { game.input.consumeAll(); start(true); }\n280\t      else if (game.input.pressed('cancel')) toMenu();\n281\t      return;\n282\t    }\n283\t    if (mode === 'full') { after.update(dt); for (const p of all) playerStep(p, dt); return; }\n284\t    talk.update(dt);\n285\t    if (mode === 'kickoff' || mode === 'goal' || mode === 'half') {\n286\t      for (const p of all) playerStep(p, dt);\n287\t      if ((kickT -= dt) <= 0) {\n288\t        if (mode === 'goal' && over) return fullTime();\n289\t        if (mode === 'goal' || mode === 'half') kickoff(restartBy);\n290\t        else { mode = 'play'; owner = team[restartBy][0]; kickHold = 2.5; A.sfx('whistle'); }\n291\t      }\n292\t      return;\n293\t    }\n294\t    clock += dt; kickHold = Math.max(0, kickHold - dt);\n295\t    for (const p of all) playerStep(p, dt);\n296\t    ballStep(dt); curlT = Math.max(0, curlT - dt); autoSwitch();\n297\t    if (!golden && half === 1 && clock >= HALF) { half = 2; mode = 'half'; kickT = 2.4; restartBy = 1; owner = null; A.sfx('whistle'); say('HALF TIME: GULLS ' + score[0] + ', RUST ' + score[1] + '.'); }\n298\t    else if (!golden && clock >= HALF * 2) {\n299\t      if (score[0] === score[1]) { golden = true; clock = HALF * 2; A.sfx('whistle'); say('LEVEL AT FULL TIME: GOLDEN GOAL! THE NEXT ONE WINS IT.'); kickoff(0); }\n300\t      else fullTime();\n301\t    } else if (golden && clock >= HALF * 2 + GOLDEN) fullTime();\n302\t  }\n303\t  function fullTime() {\n304\t    mode = 'full'; over = true; owner = null; A.sfx('whistle'); after.i = 0;\n305\t    const w = score[0] > score[1] ? 0 : score[1] > score[0] ? 1 : -1; for (const p of all) p.cheer = p.side === w ? 99 : 0;\n306\t    say(w < 0 ? 'FULL TIME: A DRAW IN THE CAGE.' : 'FULL TIME! THE ' + TEAMS[w].name + ' WIN IT, ' + Math.max(...score) + ' - ' + Math.min(...score) + '.');\n307\t    if (!scripted) A.music(w === 0 || vs ? 'victory' : null);\n308\t  }\n309\t\n310\t  /* ---- DRAWING: the cage, the posts, the players, the ball and its shadow; the score, the clock, the meter, the radar ---- */\n311\t  function draw(r) {\n312\t    if (mode === 'menu' || mode === 'join') return drawMenu(r);\n313\t    const view = E.charView(r.view);\n314\t    map.drawFloor(r); map.queueWalls(r);\n315\t    for (const f of CROWD) {   // (cheering on the scoring side's goal, else a sway)\n316\t      const up = mode === 'goal' && stats.goals.length && stats.goals[stats.goals.length - 1][0] === f.side ? Math.abs(Math.sin(t * 9 + f.ph)) * 5 : Math.sin(t * 2 + f.ph) * .6;\n317\t      r.queue(f.x, f.y, f.z + up, g => { const [x, y] = r.w(f.x, f.y, f.z + up), X = Math.round(x), Y = Math.round(y); px.rect(g, X - 2, Y - 5, 4, 5, f.shirt); px.rect(g, X - 1, Y - 8, 3, 3, f.skin); });\n318\t    }\n319\t    for (const gx of [X0, X1]) for (const py of [CY - GH, CY + GH]) r.queue(gx, py, 0, g => { const [x, y] = r.w(gx, py, 0), [, y1] = r.w(gx, py, BAR); px.rect(g, Math.round(x) - 1, Math.round(y1), 2, Math.round(y - y1), '#f4f4f0'); });\n320\t    for (const gx of [X0, X1]) r.queue(gx, CY + GH, BAR, g => { const [x0, y0] = r.w(gx, CY - GH, BAR), [x1, y1] = r.w(gx, CY + GH, BAR); px.line(g, Math.round(x0), Math.round(y0), Math.round(x1), Math.round(y1), '#f4f4f0', 2); }, { bias: 1 });\n321\t    for (const p of all) {\n322\t      const b = p.body; r.shadow(b.x, b.y, 6, .35);\n323\t      r.actor(b.x, b.y, b.z, (g, ox, oy) => p.rig.draw(g, ox, oy, view));\n324\t      if (p.input) r.queue(b.x, b.y, 40, g => { const [x, y] = r.w(b.x, b.y, 40), c = E.PLAYER_COLORS[p.input.player || 0] || '#ffe08a'; px.poly(g, [[x - 3, y - 4], [x + 3, y - 4], [x, y]], c); }, { emissive: true });\n325\t      if (p.charging) r.queue(b.x, b.y, 44, g => { const [x, y] = r.w(b.x, b.y, 44); E.ui.bar(g, Math.round(x) - 10, Math.round(y) - 6, 20, 4, p.meter, p.meter > .8 ? '#ff6a3a' : '#ffd36a'); });\n326\t    }\n327\t    r.shadow(ball.x, ball.y, 3 - Math.min(1.5, ball.z * .05), .4);\n328\t    r.sprite(ball.x, ball.y, ball.z + 2.5, Math.floor(ball.roll / 8) % 2 ? BALL2 : BALL, { anchor: 'center' });\n329\t    r.overlay(g => hud(g, r));\n330\t    talk.draw(r);\n331\t    if (mode === 'full') { r.overlay(g => results(g, r)); after.draw(r); }\n332\t  }\n333\t  const mmss = s => Math.floor(s / 60) + ':' + String(Math.floor(s % 60)).padStart(2, '0');\n334\t  function hud(g, r) {\n335\t    // the score bug: the sides' chips and scores, the clock (counting down each half; golden goal says so)\n336\t    const left = golden ? 'GOLDEN GOAL' : (half === 1 ? '1ST ' : '2ND ') + mmss(Math.max(0, HALF * half - clock));\n337\t    E.ui.box(g, 4, 4, 132, 16, { bg: '#141826', border: '#6a7090', alpha: .85 });\n338\t    px.rect(g, 8, 9, 6, 6, TEAMS[0].chip); px.rect(g, 70, 9, 6, 6, TEAMS[1].chip);\n339\t    E.font.text(g, TEAMS[0].name + ' ' + score[0], 17, 8, '#f0ecdc', { font: 'tiny', outline: false });\n340\t    E.font.text(g, score[1] + ' ' + TEAMS[1].name, 79, 8, '#f0ecdc', { font: 'tiny', outline: false });\n341\t    E.font.text(g, left, 4, 24, golden ? '#ffd36a' : '#c8d0e8', { font: 'tiny', outline: '#000' });\n342\t    // the radar: the cage small, the players as their colors, the ball white\n343\t    const s = 2.4 / T, w = Math.round((X1 - X0) * s), h = Math.round((Y1 - Y0) * s), x0 = r.W - w - 6, ca = game.cornerArea(), y0 = ca && ca.x0 < x0 + w ? Math.ceil(ca.y1) + 4 : 26;   // (top right, under the corner's buttons or a kit's API button: the radio and the touch buttons have the bottom)\n344\t    E.ui.box(g, x0 - 2, y0 - 2, w + 4, h + 4, { bg: '#183a1e', border: '#6a9070', alpha: .75 });\n345\t    for (const p of all) px.rect(g, Math.round(x0 + (p.body.x - X0) * s) - 1, Math.round(y0 + (p.body.y - Y0) * s) - 1, 2, 2, TEAMS[p.side].chip);\n346\t    px.rect(g, Math.round(x0 + (ball.x - X0) * s), Math.round(y0 + (ball.y - Y0) * s), 1, 1, '#ffffff');\n347\t    if (mode === 'kickoff') E.font.text(g, 'KICK OFF', r.W / 2, r.H * .3, '#ffe7a8', { align: 'center', scale: 2, shadow: '#000', outline: false });\n348\t    if (mode === 'goal') E.font.title(g, 'GOAL!', r.W / 2, r.H * .28, { align: 'center', scale: 4, colors: ['#fffbe8', '#ffe08a', '#ffb347'] });\n349\t    if (mode === 'half') E.font.text(g, 'HALF TIME', r.W / 2, r.H * .3, '#ffe7a8', { align: 'center', scale: 2, shadow: '#000', outline: false });\n350\t  }\n351\t  function results(g, r) {\n352\t    const w = score[0] > score[1] ? 0 : score[1] > score[0] ? 1 : -1;\n353\t    E.ui.box(g, r.W / 2 - 110, 52, 220, 128, { bg: '#141826', border: '#e8c070', alpha: .92 });\n354\t    E.font.title(g, w < 0 ? 'A DRAW' : TEAMS[w].name + ' WIN', r.W / 2, 60, { align: 'center', scale: 2, colors: ['#fffbe8', '#ffe08a', '#ffb347'] });\n355\t    E.font.text(g, 'GULLS ' + score[0] + ' - ' + score[1] + ' RUST', r.W / 2, 86, '#f0ecdc', { align: 'center', outline: false });\n356\t    stats.goals.slice(-5).forEach(([s, name, at], i) => E.font.text(g, mmss(at) + '  ' + name + ' (' + TEAMS[s].name + ')', r.W / 2, 100 + i * 9, '#c8d0e8', { align: 'center', font: 'tiny', outline: false }));\n357\t  }\n358\t  function drawMenu(r) {\n359\t    r.sky(['#0e1630', '#1e3050', '#2e5a3a']);\n360\t    r.overlay(g => {\n361\t      E.font.title(g, 'CAGE CUP', r.W / 2, 34, { align: 'center', scale: 3, colors: ['#fffbe8', '#ffe08a', '#ffb347', '#e0662a'], depth: 2 });\n362\t      E.font.text(g, 'TWO AGAINST TWO, UP TO FOUR PLAYERS', r.W / 2, 70, '#c8d0e8', { align: 'center', outline: false });\n363\t      if (mode === 'join') {\n364\t        const P = game.players;\n365\t        E.font.text(g, 'VERSUS: PRESS 2 ON THE KEYBOARD, OR START ON A PAD, TO JOIN', r.W / 2, 96, '#ffe7a8', { align: 'center', font: 'tiny', outline: false });\n366\t        ['P1 GULLS', 'P2 RUST', 'P3 GULLS', 'P4 RUST'].forEach((s, i) => E.font.text(g, s + (P[i] ? '  READY' : '  ...'), r.W / 2 - 40, 112 + i * 12, P[i] ? E.PLAYER_COLORS[i] : '#6a7090', { outline: false }));\n367\t        E.font.text(g, prompt('confirm', 'PLAY') + '   ' + prompt('cancel', 'BACK'), r.W / 2, 172, '#c8d0e8', { align: 'center', font: 'tiny', outline: false });\n368\t      }\n369\t    });\n370\t    if (mode === 'menu') menu.draw(r);\n371\t  }\n372\t\n373\t  /* ---- THE CONTROLS: the default preset's stick with three buttons of its own ---- */\n374\t  const KEYS = Object.assign({}, E.Input.DEFAULT, { pass: ['KeyJ', 'KeyX', 'Pad0'], shoot: ['KeyK', 'KeyZ', 'Pad2'], lob: ['KeyL', 'KeyC', 'Pad3'] });\n375\t  for (const k of ['attack', 'dash', 'skill', 'jump']) delete KEYS[k];\n376\t\n377\t  /** the proof: a match from the kickoff, player 1 running at goal, passing, lobbing, shooting; a hash of the match */\n378\t  const run = (n = 600) => proof('sports', n, (i, k) => {\n379\t    if (i === 1) start(false);\n380\t    if (i === 140) k.hold('right'); if (i === 200) k.tap('pass'); if (i === 300) k.tap('lob');\n381\t    if (i === 380) k.hold('shoot'); if (i === 440) k.up('shoot'); if (i === 520) k.up('right');\n382\t  }, () => [Math.round(ball.x), Math.round(ball.y), Math.round(ball.z), score, all.map(p => [Math.round(p.body.x), Math.round(p.body.y)]), stats.passes, stats.shots, owner ? owner.name : null]);\n383\t  /** the bot: player 1 plays a match by the game's own rules (the stick and the buttons, as a player gives them, from the\n384\t   *  CPU's own judgment for its player) to the final whistle; then four players, each holding one footballer, for a\n385\t   *  stretch. Returns { full, score, goals, passes, done, lobs, shots, curled, tackles, four, seconds, errors } */\n386\t  function bot(s = 1) {\n387\t    const was = Math.random; Math.random = E.rng(s); const I = game.input, held = new Set(), hold = (a, on) => { if (on && !held.has(a)) { held.add(a); I.hold(a); } else if (!on && held.has(a)) { held.delete(a); I.hold(a, false); } };\n388\t    scripted = true;\n389\t    try {\n390\t      game.go('sports', null, { fade: 0 }); game.advance(1 / 120); start(false);\n391\t      let n = 0;\n392\t      for (; n < 120 * 400 && mode !== 'full'; n++) {\n393\t        const me = team[0].find(p => p.input);\n394\t        if (me && mode === 'play') {\n395\t          const c = brain(me, 1 / 120), mv = curlT > 0 && last === me && !owner ? [0, 0] : c.move;   // what the CPU would do in its place, given as the stick and buttons (still while its shot flies: no curl)\n396\t          hold('right', mv[0] > .35); hold('left', mv[0] < -.35); hold('down', mv[1] > .35); hold('up', mv[1] < -.35);\n397\t          if (c.pass) I.tap('pass'); if (c.lob) I.tap('lob'); hold('shoot', c.shootHeld);\n398\t        } else for (const a of ['right', 'left', 'up', 'down', 'shoot']) hold(a, false);\n399\t        game.advance(1 / 120);\n400\t      }\n401\t      for (const a of [...held]) hold(a, false);\n402\t      const r = { full: mode === 'full', score: score.slice(), goals: stats.goals.length, passes: stats.passes, done: stats.done, lobs: stats.lobs, shots: stats.shots, curled: stats.curled, tackles: stats.tackles, walls: stats.walls, seconds: Math.round(n / 120) };\n403\t      // four players: three more join, each footballer held by an input; a stretch of play, each pushing its stick\n404\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"49428dbe-779b-4248-8ac3-c582018d3c3d","uuid":"3e692035-d8dd-4c1a-8c48-60210f6b3f23","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:07:14.429Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/.claude/projects/-home-micha-dev-cc-matrix-runs-claude-opus-5-5-medium-build--20261104-070556--xb697dc-work/49428dbe-779b-4248-8ac3-c582018d3c3d/tool-results/b5v7mzu8a.txt","content":"/bin/bash: line 1: cd: kits: No such file or directory\n/* =====================================================================================\n * SLICE 22  SPORTS  (Sensible Soccer, NBA Jam, Tecmo Bowl).\n * Two against two in a walled cage, for up to four players: the GULLS against the RUST, two halves on the clock, a\n * golden goal if it ends level. The ball is a Body: it rolls, bounces off the ground and the boards, and curls.\n * KEYS: the stick runs; J passes (to the teammate the stick points at, led to where it is going), L lobs one over a\n * defender (its arc solved by E.arc to land at the teammate's feet), K held fills the shot meter and shoots on letting go\n * (the stick across the goal aims it; pushed sideways just after, it curls: aftertouch). Without the ball: J slides in\n * to tackle, K switches to the teammate nearer the ball. TOUCH: the stick, PASS, SHOOT (hold), LOB.\n * PLAYERS: MATCH is you against the CPU; VERSUS lets players 2 to 4 in (2 on the keyboard, or Start on a pad): player 2\n * takes the RUST, 3 and 4 the second of each side. The rest are run by formation: with the ball, the other one runs\n * ahead on the far side; without it, the nearer presses and the other covers the goal. Commentary on Dialog's radio.\n * Deep links: #sports/match (a match against the CPU), #sports/vs (VERSUS: players 2 to 4 join).\n * HOW IT WORKS: a TileMap cage (boards that cut low before the camera, nets), the ball and the players as E.Body, rigs\n * that kick and slide (E.Attack), E.arc for the lob, game.allowJoin for players; SPORTS.run(n) is the proof,\n * SPORTS.bot() plays a match through to its whistle and then a short one with four players.\n * ===================================================================================== */\nconst SPORTS = (() => {\n  const A = game.audio, T = 16, FW = 36, FH = 22, ND = 2, GOAL = 5, BAR = 28, HALF = 60, GOLDEN = 45, PI = Math.PI;\n  /* ---- THE CAGE: a field of FW x FH tiles inside boards (cut low where they hide it), a goal in each end with its net,\n   * a stand of three tiers behind the north boards; built from rows: # boards, N net, . the field, : the net's floor,\n   * 1 2 3 the stand's tiers (back to front), , outside ---- */\n  const STAND = 3, COLS = ND + FW + 2 + ND, ROWS = STAND + FH + 2, MID = FH / 2, goalRow = r => r > MID - GOAL / 2 && r <= MID + GOAL / 2;\n  const rows = [];\n  for (let R = 0; R < ROWS; R++) {\n    let s = ''; const r = R - STAND;   // (the cage's own row)\n    for (let c = 0; c < COLS; c++) {\n      const field = c > ND && c <= ND + FW && r > 0 && r <= FH, endCol = c === ND || c === ND + FW + 1, net = (c < ND || c > ND + FW + 1);\n      if (r < 0) s += c >= ND && c <= ND + FW + 1 ? String(R + 1) : ',';\n      else if (field) s += '.';\n      else if (endCol && r > 0 && r <= FH) s += goalRow(r) ? '.' : '#';\n      else if ((r === 0 || r === FH + 1) && c >= ND && c <= ND + FW + 1) s += '#';\n      else if (net && goalRow(r)) s += c === 0 || c === COLS - 1 ? 'N' : ':';\n      else if (net && (goalRow(r + 1) || goalRow(r - 1))) s += 'N';\n      else s += ',';\n    }\n    rows.push(s);\n  }\n  const X0 = (ND + 1) * T, X1 = (ND + 1 + FW) * T, Y0 = (STAND + 1) * T, Y1 = (STAND + FH + 1) * T, CX = (X0 + X1) / 2, CY = (Y0 + Y1) / 2, GH = GOAL * T / 2;\n  // the pitch: mown stripes with the grass's own grain, painted lines a little worn (the halfway line, the centre circle,\n  // an arc before each goal), the nets' shadow on their floor, tarmac outside\n  const line = (x, y) => {\n    const d = Math.hypot(x - CX, y - CY), ex = Math.min(Math.abs(x - X0), Math.abs(x - X1)), ey = Math.min(Math.abs(y - Y0), Math.abs(y - Y1));\n    if (ex < 1.5 || ey < 1.5 || Math.abs(x - CX) < 1 || Math.abs(d - 48) < 1) return true;\n    for (const gx of [X0, X1]) if (Math.abs(Math.hypot(x - gx, y - CY) - 72) < 1 && Math.abs(x - gx) < 72) return true;\n    return false;\n  };\n  const floorTex = (x, y, tag) => {\n    const n = E.hash2(Math.floor(x), Math.floor(y)) - .5, m = E.noise2(x * .06, y * .06) * .5;\n    if (tag === 'net') { const mesh = Math.floor(x) % 4 === 0 || Math.floor(y) % 4 === 0; return mesh ? [30, 66, 36] : [44 + n * 10, 92 + n * 14, 50 + n * 10]; }\n    if (tag === 'out') return [44 + n * 18, 42 + n * 18, 50 + n * 18];\n    if (line(x, y)) { const w = 228 + n * 24 + m * 10; return [w, w + 4, w - 8]; }\n    const k = Math.floor((x - X0) / 32) % 2 ? 1 : 0, g = (k ? 140 : 106) + n * 34 + m * 24;   // (a stripe mown each way: lighter, darker)\n    return [g * .42, g, g * .46];\n  };\n  let map = null;\n  const makeMap = () => new E.TileMap({ rows, legend: { '#': 1, N: 2, 1: 5, 2: 4, 3: 3, '.': { floor: 'grass' }, ':': { floor: 'net' }, ',': { floor: 'out' } }, floorTex, outside: '#1e1c24', ao: 4,\n    types: { 1: { h: 26, cut: true, cutH: 6, face: 'plank', side: '#3a4a6a', top: '#d8dce8', line: '#2a3450' }, 2: { h: BAR + 4, face: 'none', side: '#b8bcc8', top: '#e0e4ec' },\n      3: { h: 34, face: 'stone', side: '#5a5468', top: '#6a6478' }, 4: { h: 44, face: 'stone', side: '#4e4a5e', top: '#5e586e' }, 5: { h: 54, face: 'stone', side: '#44405a', top: '#544e66' } } });\n  // the crowd: two on each tile of the stand, in their colors, bobbing; on a goal, those of the side that scored jump\n  const CROWD = [];\n  for (let R = 0; R < STAND; R++) for (let c = ND; c <= ND + FW + 1; c++) for (const dx of [4, 12]) {\n    const h = E.hash2(c * 3 + dx, R * 7 + 1), side = h < .5 ? 0 : 1;\n    CROWD.push({ x: c * T + dx, y: R * T + 9, z: [54, 44, 34][R], side, shirt: side ? ['#c8502a', '#e07040', '#a83a1a'][(h * 30 | 0) % 3] : ['#eef0f6', '#2a5ab8', '#8ab0f0'][(h * 30 | 0) % 3], skin: ['#e0b090', '#a87050', '#6a4028', '#f0c8a8'][(h * 50 | 0) % 4], ph: h * 9 });\n  }\n  /* ---- THE TEAMS: their colors, names and players; the ball ---- */\n  const TEAMS = [\n    { name: 'GULLS', colors: { cloth: '#eef0f6', pants: '#2a5ab8', boot: '#1e2030', belt: '#2a5ab8', trim: '#2a5ab8' }, chip: '#eef0f6', players: [['NOOR', '#3a2418', '#c89070'], ['BEX', '#e8c070', '#f0c8a8']] },\n    { name: 'RUST', colors: { cloth: '#c8502a', pants: '#2a2a30', boot: '#1a1a1e', belt: '#1a1a1e', trim: '#e8c070' }, chip: '#c8502a', players: [['DRAGO', '#1e1c1a', '#a87050'], ['KIT', '#6a3a22', '#e0b090']] }];\n  const SPEED = 92, AI_SPEED = 86, KICK_CD = .3;\n  const BALL = E.sprite(['.www.', 'wwkww', 'wkkkw', 'wwkww', '.www.'], { w: '#f4f4f0', k: '#2a2a30' });\n  const BALL2 = E.sprite(['.www.', 'wkwkw', 'wwwww', 'wkwkw', '.www.'], { w: '#f4f4f0', k: '#2a2a30' });\n  const SOUNDS = {\n    kick: { wave: 'noise', freq: 900, to: 200, dur: .07, vol: .3, filter: 'lowpass' }, thump: { wave: 'sine', freq: 120, to: 70, dur: .08, vol: .3 },\n    whistle: { wave: 'square', freq: 2200, vib: [30, .05], dur: .32, vol: .14 }, post: { wave: 'triangle', freq: 1400, to: 1100, dur: .3, vol: .25 },\n    crowd: { wave: 'noise', freq: 600, to: 900, dur: 1.4, vol: .18, filter: 'lowpass' }, slide: { wave: 'noise', freq: 400, to: 200, dur: .25, vol: .18 }\n  };\n  for (const [k, v] of Object.entries(SOUNDS)) A.define(k, v);\n  const SONG = { bpm: 140, steps: 4, tracks: [   // the cage: a bright chant over a bouncing bass\n    { wave: 'square', vol: .07, notes: 'E5 . E5 G5 . E5 D5 . | C5 . C5 E5 . C5 B4 . | A4 . C5 . E5 . A5 . | G5 - - . . . . .' },\n    { wave: 'triangle', vol: .3, notes: 'C3 . G2 . C3 . G2 . | A2 . E2 . A2 . E2 . | F2 . C3 . F2 . C3 . | G2 . D3 . G2 . B2 .' },\n    { wave: 'drums', vol: .1, notes: 'k . h . s . h k | k . h . s h h .' }] };\n\n  /* ---- THE STATE ---- */\n  let mode = 'menu', vs = false, team = [], all = [], ball = null, owner = null, last = null, clock = 0, half = 1, score = [0, 0], kickT = 0, t = 0, scripted = false;\n  let stats = null, curlT = 0, golden = false, restartBy = 0, over = false, kickHold = 0;   // kickHold: the kickoff's rule (the other side out of the circle) until the ball is played\n  const menu = new E.Menu(game, ['MATCH', 'VERSUS (2-4 PLAYERS)', 'BACK'], { onPick: i => i === 2 ? game.go('title') : i === 1 ? versus() : start(false) });\n  const after = new E.Menu(game, ['REMATCH', 'MENU'], { y: 150, onPick: i => i === 0 ? start(vs) : toMenu() });\n  const talk = new E.Dialog(game, { lines: 2, place: 'bottom', border: '#e8c070' });   // (at the bottom: clear of the score and of the touch buttons)\n  const VOICE = new E.Humanoid({ weapon: null, hat: 'band', colors: { cloth: '#3a3a4a', hair: '#5a3a2a', skin: '#e0b090', hat: '#2a2a30' } });\n  const say = text => { if (!scripted) talk.say(text, { name: 'CAGE RADIO', auto: 2.2, modal: false, alpha: .8, portrait: VOICE, portraitOpts: { zoom: 3, turn: .4 } }); };\n\n  function toMenu() { mode = 'menu'; game.splitScreen(0); game.allowJoin(false); A.music('title'); menu.i = 0; }\n  function versus() { vs = true; mode = 'join'; game.allowJoin({ max: 4 }); A.sfx('select'); }\n  /** a match: the four on the pitch, the ball at the centre, the clock at 0; players: who holds which (the inputs) */\n  function start(versus) {\n    vs = versus; map = map || makeMap(); score = [0, 0]; clock = 0; half = 1; golden = false; over = false; owner = null; last = null;\n    stats = { passes: 0, done: 0, shots: 0, lobs: 0, tackles: 0, goals: [], walls: 0, curled: 0 };\n    all = []; team = [[], []];\n    TEAMS.forEach((tm, s) => tm.players.forEach(([name, hair, skin], k) => {\n      const b = new E.Body({ x: CX, y: CY, r: 5, friction: 0, gravity: 700 });\n      const p = { side: s, k, name, body: b, rig: new E.Humanoid({ weapon: null, build: 'heroic', size: 1.05, hair: k ? 'spiky' : 'short', colors: Object.assign({ hair, skin }, tm.colors), speedRef: 80 }),\n        input: null, facing: s ? PI : 0, kick: null, slide: 0, stun: 0, cool: 0, meter: 0, charging: false, cheer: 0 };\n      team[s].push(p); all.push(p);\n    }));\n    // who holds whom: player 1 the GULLS' first (and, alone, whichever GULL is nearer the ball); in versus 2 the RUST, 3 and 4\n    // the second of each side\n    const P = game.players;\n    team[0][0].input = P[0];\n    if (vs) { if (P[1]) team[1][0].input = P[1]; if (P[2]) team[0][1].input = P[2]; if (P[3]) team[1][1].input = P[3]; }\n    ball = new E.Body({ x: CX, y: CY, r: 3, friction: 0, bounce: .55, gravity: 600 }); ball.spin = 0; ball.roll = 0;\n    kickoff(0); game.allowJoin(false); A.music(SONG); game.input.consumeAll();\n    game.follow(ball, { z: 8, lead: 10 }); game.cam.smooth = .18; game.cam.bounds = v => map.bounds(v);\n    say('THE GULLS AGAINST THE RUST IN THE CAGE. HERE WE GO!');\n  }\n  /** the formation's spots: kicking off (s kicks), or in play (a team's two by where the ball is and who has it) */\n  const goalX = s => s ? X0 : X1;   // where side s shoots (the GULLS attack the right end)\n  function kickoff(s) {\n    owner = null; ball.x = CX; ball.y = CY; ball.z = 0; ball.onGround = true; ball.vx = ball.vy = ball.vz = 0; ball.spin = 0;\n    for (const p of all) {\n      const dir = p.side ? 1 : -1, b = p.body;\n      b.x = p.side === s && p.k === 0 ? CX + dir * 8 : CX + dir * (p.k ? 150 : 60); b.y = p.side === s && p.k === 0 ? CY : CY + (p.k ? 40 : -40) * (p.side ? -1 : 1);\n      b.vx = b.vy = 0; b.z = 0; p.facing = p.side ? PI : 0; p.kick = null; p.slide = 0; p.stun = 0; p.meter = 0; p.charging = false;\n    }\n    mode = 'kickoff'; kickT = 1; restartBy = s;\n  }\n  /** a player's spot in the formation now: with the ball (or near it), go for it; else, attacking, ahead on the far\n   *  side; defending, between the ball and its own goal */\n  function spot(p) {\n    const s = p.side, mate = team[s][1 - p.k], dir = s ? -1 : 1, has = owner && owner.side === s;\n    if (has) return [clamp(ball.x + dir * 90, X0 + 30, X1 - 30), CY + (ball.y < CY ? 60 : -60)];\n    const own = goalX(1 - s), near = Math.hypot(p.body.x - ball.x, p.body.y - ball.y) <= Math.hypot(mate.body.x - ball.x, mate.body.y - ball.y);\n    if (near) return [ball.x, ball.y];\n    return [lerp(ball.x, own, .55), lerp(ball.y, CY, .5)];\n  }\n\n  /* ---- THE BALL: owned (at its owner's feet), or loose: a Body that rolls, bounces off the ground and the boards and\n   * curls by its spin; a goal, over the bar, out of the cage ---- */\n  function ballStep(dt) {\n    if (owner) {\n      const b = owner.body, f = owner.facing; ball.x = b.x + Math.cos(f) * 7; ball.y = b.y + Math.sin(f) * 7; ball.z = 0; ball.onGround = true;\n      ball.vx = b.vx; ball.vy = b.vy; ball.vz = 0; ball.roll += Math.hypot(b.vx, b.vy) * dt; return;\n    }\n    const vx0 = ball.vx, vy0 = ball.vy, sp = Math.hypot(ball.vx, ball.vy);\n    if (ball.spin && sp > 20) { const k = ball.spin * dt; ball.vx += -vy0 / sp * k * sp; ball.vy += vx0 / sp * k * sp; ball.spin *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4); }   // curl: across its path\n    if (ball.z <= .5) { const f = Math.exp(-dt * 1.1); ball.vx *= f; ball.vy *= f; }   // rolling slows it\n    ball.update(dt, map);   // (the Body bounces off the boards and the ground by its bounce)\n    if (ball.hitWall) { ball.spin = 0; stats.walls++; if (Math.hypot(vx0, vy0) > 60) A.sfx('thump'); }\n    if (ball.bounced) A.sfx('thump');\n    ball.roll += Math.hypot(ball.vx, ball.vy) * dt;\n    // a goal: over the line between the posts and under the bar; over it, a goal kick; out of the cage, thrown back in\n    for (const s of [0, 1]) {\n      const gx = goalX(s), past = s ? ball.x < gx - 2 : ball.x > gx + 2;\n      if (past && Math.abs(ball.y - CY) < GH && ball.z < BAR) return goal(s);\n      if (past && (ball.z >= BAR || Math.abs(ball.y - CY) >= GH)) return restart(1 - s, s ? X0 + 24 : X1 - 24, CY, 'OVER THE BAR. A GOAL KICK');\n    }\n    if (ball.x < X0 - 40 || ball.x > X1 + 40 || ball.y < Y0 - 4 || ball.y > Y1 + 4) restart(last ? 1 - last.side : 0, clamp(ball.x, X0 + 12, X1 - 12), clamp(ball.y, Y0 + 12, Y1 - 12), 'OUT OF THE CAGE! THROWN BACK IN');\n  }\n  /** play goes on from (x, y) with the ball at the feet of side s's nearer player */\n  function restart(s, x, y, line) {\n    const p = team[s].slice().sort((a, b) => Math.hypot(a.body.x - x, a.body.y - y) - Math.hypot(b.body.x - x, b.body.y - y))[0];\n    p.body.x = x - (s ? -8 : 8); p.body.y = y; p.facing = s ? PI : 0; owner = p; ball.spin = 0; A.sfx('whistle'); if (line) say(line);\n  }\n  function goal(s) {\n    score[s]++; stats.goals.push([s, last ? last.name : '?', Math.round(clock)]); owner = null; mode = 'goal'; kickT = 2.4; restartBy = 1 - s;\n    for (const p of team[s]) p.cheer = 2.4; game.shake(3); A.sfx('crowd'); A.sfx('whistle');\n    P.sparks(ball.x, ball.y, 16, 16, null, { color: '#ffe08a' }); P.ring(ball.x, ball.y, 4, 34, '#fff6c0', .5);\n    say(golden ? 'GOLDEN GOAL! ' + (last ? last.name : '') + ' WINS IT FOR THE ' + TEAMS[s].name + '!' : 'GOAL! ' + (last ? last.name + ' SCORES FOR THE ' : 'THE ') + TEAMS[s].name + '! ' + score[0] + ' - ' + score[1]);\n    if (golden) { over = true; }\n  }\n\n  /* ---- KICKS: a pass along the ground led to the teammate, a lob over by E.arc, a shot from the meter with aftertouch ---- */\n  /** the teammate a pass goes to: the one the stick points at (within 70 degrees), else the other */\n  const mateOf = p => team[p.side][1 - p.k];\n  function pass(p) {\n    const m = mateOf(p), b = p.body, d = Math.hypot(m.body.x - b.x, m.body.y - b.y), sp = clamp(d * 1.5 + 90, 150, 270), lead = d / sp;\n    const tx = m.body.x + m.body.vx * lead * .8, ty = m.body.y + m.body.vy * lead * .8, a = Math.atan2(ty - b.y, tx - b.x);\n    release(p, Math.cos(a) * sp, Math.sin(a) * sp, 0); stats.passes++; ball.to = m;\n  }\n  function lob(p) {\n    const m = mateOf(p), lead = .55, tx = m.body.x + m.body.vx * lead, ty = m.body.y + m.body.vy * lead;\n    const v = E.arc({ x: ball.x, y: ball.y, z: 0 }, { x: tx, y: ty, z: 0 }, ball.gravity, { apex: 30 });\n    release(p, v.vx, v.vy, v.vz); stats.lobs++; stats.passes++; ball.to = m;\n  }\n  /** a shot: power from the meter (0..1), aimed across the goal mouth by the stick's up and down */\n  function shoot(p, power, aimY) {\n    const gx = goalX(p.side), gy = CY + clamp(aimY, -1, 1) * (GH - 6), b = p.body, a = Math.atan2(gy - b.y, gx - b.x), sp = 170 + power * 230;\n    release(p, Math.cos(a) * sp, Math.sin(a) * sp, 30 + power * 95); stats.shots++; curlT = .4; ball.to = null; A.sfx('kick');\n  }\n  function release(p, vx, vy, vz) {\n    owner = null; last = p; kickHold = 0; ball.vx = vx; ball.vy = vy; ball.vz = vz; ball.onGround = vz <= 0; ball.spin = 0; p.cool = KICK_CD; p.kick = new E.Attack('kick'); p.kick.start(); A.sfx('kick');\n  }\n  /** a slide tackle: a dash along its facing; whoever it meets with the ball loses it */\n  function tackle(p) { p.slide = .35; p.kick = new E.Attack('sweep'); p.kick.start(); stats.tackles++; A.sfx('slide'); const b = p.body; b.vx = Math.cos(p.facing) * 170; b.vy = Math.sin(p.facing) * 170; }\n\n  /* ---- A PLAYER'S STEP: from its input (a human's) or its brain (the formation's), then its body and its rig ---- */\n  function playerStep(p, dt) {\n    const b = p.body; p.cool = Math.max(0, p.cool - dt); p.stun = Math.max(0, p.stun - dt); p.cheer = Math.max(0, p.cheer - dt);\n    let mx = 0, my = 0;\n    if (p.slide > 0) { p.slide -= dt; const f = Math.exp(-dt * 3); b.vx *= f; b.vy *= f; }\n    else if (p.stun > 0 || mode !== 'play') { b.vx = approach(b.vx, 0, 600 * dt); b.vy = approach(b.vy, 0, 600 * dt); }\n    else {\n      const c = p.input ? human(p, dt) : brain(p, dt); mx = c.move[0]; my = c.move[1];\n      const sp = p.input ? SPEED : AI_SPEED, m = Math.hypot(mx, my);\n      b.vx = approach(b.vx, mx * sp, 900 * dt); b.vy = approach(b.vy, my * sp, 900 * dt);\n      if (m > .2) p.facing = E.approachAng(p.facing, Math.atan2(my, mx), dt * (owner === p ? 9 : 14));\n      act(p, c, dt);\n    }\n    b.update(dt, map);\n    // the loose ball: whoever reaches it first takes it (not just after kicking it, nor a ball high in the air, and a fast one only\n    // right at its feet)\n    if (!owner && mode === 'play' && p.cool <= 0 && p.stun <= 0 && ball.z < 9 && Math.hypot(ball.x - b.x, ball.y - b.y) < (Math.hypot(ball.vx, ball.vy) > 210 ? 4.5 : 9)) {   // (a hard shot is hard to trap)\n      owner = p; ball.spin = 0; if (ball.to === p && last && last.side === p.side) stats.done++; ball.to = null;\n      if (p.slide > 0) p.slide = 0;\n    }\n    // a slide that meets the ball's holder knocks it loose\n    if (p.slide > 0 && owner && owner.side !== p.side && Math.hypot(owner.body.x - b.x, owner.body.y - b.y) < 12) {\n      const o = owner; owner = null; o.stun = .5; last = p; ball.vx = Math.cos(p.facing) * 120; ball.vy = Math.sin(p.facing) * 120; ball.vz = 40; ball.onGround = false; p.cool = .2; A.sfx('thump');\n    }\n    if (p.kick) { p.kick.update(dt); if (!p.kick.busy) p.kick = null; }\n    p.rig.update(dt, { x: b.x, y: b.y, z: b.z, vx: b.vx, vy: b.vy, facing: p.facing, attack: p.kick && p.kick.state, hurt: p.stun > 0, pose: p.cheer > 0 ? 'cheer' : null, expr: p.cheer > 0 ? 'shout' : null });\n  }\n  /** what a human's input asks: the stick; pass, lob, the shot's meter (held), a tackle or a switch */\n  function human(p, dt) {\n    const I = p.input, mv = I.move(), c = { move: mv, pass: I.pressed('pass'), lob: I.pressed('lob'), shootHeld: I.down('shoot'), shootUp: I.released('shoot'), aim: mv[1] * (p.side ? -1 : 1) };\n    if (c.pass) I.consume('pass'); if (c.lob) I.consume('lob');\n    // aftertouch: just after a shot, the stick across its path curls the ball\n    if (curlT > 0 && last === p && !owner) { const sp = Math.hypot(ball.vx, ball.vy) || 1, across = (mv[0] * -ball.vy + mv[1] * ball.vx) / sp; if (Math.abs(across) > .3) { ball.spin = clamp(ball.spin + across * 3.2 * dt, -1.6, 1.6); stats.curled++; } }\n    return c;\n  }\n  /** the CPU's footballer: to its spot in the formation; with the ball, run at goal, pass when pressed, shoot in range */\n  function brain(p, dt) {\n    const b = p.body, c = { move: [0, 0], pass: false, lob: false, shootHeld: false, shootUp: false, aim: 0 }, s = p.side;\n    if (owner === p) {\n      const gx = goalX(s), dg = Math.hypot(gx - b.x, CY - b.y), foe = team[1 - s].find(o => Math.hypot(o.body.x - b.x, o.body.y - b.y) < 30 && Math.abs(E.angDiff(Math.atan2(o.body.y - b.y, o.body.x - b.x), p.facing)) < 1.2);\n      const a = Math.atan2(CY - b.y, gx - b.x); c.move = [Math.cos(a), Math.sin(a)];\n      const shot = (meter, aim) => { c.shootHeld = p.meter < meter; c.shootUp = !c.shootHeld; c.aim = b.y < CY ? aim : -aim; };   // (held until the meter is where it wants it)\n      if (dg < 95 && p.cool <= 0) shot(.4, .45);   // close in: shoot, pressed or not\n      else if (foe) { const m = mateOf(p), lane = team[1 - s].some(o => segDist(o.body, b, m.body) < 14); if (p.cool <= 0) { if (lane) c.lob = true; else c.pass = true; } else c.move = [Math.cos(a + 1.1), Math.sin(a + 1.1)]; }\n      else if (dg < 160 && p.cool <= 0) shot(.55 + p.k * .2, .55);\n      return c;\n    }\n    let [tx, ty] = spot(p);\n    if (kickHold > 0 && s !== restartBy) { const cd = Math.hypot(tx - CX, ty - CY) || 1; if (cd < 56) { tx = CX + (tx - CX) / cd * 56; ty = CY + (ty - CY) / cd * 56; } }   // (the kickoff: out of the circle)\n    const dx = tx - b.x, dy = ty - b.y, d = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\n    if (d > 6) c.move = [dx / d, dy / d];\n    // pressing the holder: slide in when close and in front of it\n    if (owner && owner.side !== s && d < 18 && p.cool <= 0 && Math.hypot(owner.body.x - b.x, owner.body.y - b.y) < 16) c.pass = true;\n    return c;\n  }\n  const segDist = (o, a, b) => { const vx = b.x - a.x, vy = b.y - a.y, l = vx * vx + vy * vy || 1, u = clamp(((o.x - a.x) * vx + (o.y - a.y) * vy) / l, 0, 1); return Math.hypot(a.x + vx * u - o.x, a.y + vy * u - o.y); };\n  /** the buttons: with the ball, pass, lob or the shot's meter; without it, a tackle (pass) or a switch (shoot) */\n  function act(p, c, dt) {\n    if (owner === p) {\n      if (c.pass && p.cool <= 0) return pass(p);\n      if (c.lob && p.cool <= 0) return lob(p);\n      if (c.shootHeld) { p.charging = true; p.meter = Math.min(1, p.meter + dt * 1.25); }\n      else if (p.charging && (c.shootUp || !c.shootHeld)) { p.charging = false; shoot(p, p.meter, c.aim); p.meter = 0; }\n      return;\n    }\n    p.charging = false; p.meter = 0;\n    if (c.pass && p.cool <= 0 && p.slide <= 0 && !(kickHold > 0 && p.side !== restartBy)) tackle(p);\n    else if (c.shootUp && p.input && !vs) swap(p);\n  }\n  /** player 1 alone holds whichever GULL is nearer the ball when the other side has it (or K switches) */\n  function swap(p) { const m = mateOf(p); if (m.input) return; m.input = p.input; p.input = null; }\n  function autoSwitch() {\n    if (vs) return;\n    const s = 0, cur = team[s].find(p => p.input), m = cur && mateOf(cur);\n    if (!cur || !m || m.input) return;\n    if (owner === m || (ball.to === m) || ((!owner || owner.side !== s) && Math.hypot(m.body.x - ball.x, m.body.y - ball.y) + 24 < Math.hypot(cur.body.x - ball.x, cur.body.y - ball.y))) swap(cur);\n  }\n\n  /* ---- A STEP OF THE MATCH: the clock, the halves, golden goal, the whistle ---- */\n  function update(dt) {\n    t += dt;\n    if (mode === 'menu') { if (!menu.update(dt)) pickOnStart(menu); return; }\n    if (mode === 'join') {\n      if (game.input.pressed('start') || game.input.pressed('confirm')) { game.input.consumeAll(); start(true); }\n      else if (game.input.pressed('cancel')) toMenu();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (mode === 'full') { after.update(dt); for (const p of all) playerStep(p, dt); return; }\n    talk.update(dt);\n    if (mode === 'kickoff' || mode === 'goal' || mode === 'half') {\n      for (const p of all) playerStep(p, dt);\n      if ((kickT -= dt) <= 0) {\n        if (mode === 'goal' && over) return fullTime();\n        if (mode === 'goal' || mode === 'half') kickoff(restartBy);\n        else { mode = 'play'; owner = team[restartBy][0]; kickHold = 2.5; A.sfx('whistle'); }\n      }\n      return;\n    }\n    clock += dt; kickHold = Math.max(0, kickHold - dt);\n    for (const p of all) playerStep(p, dt);\n    ballStep(dt); curlT = Math.max(0, curlT - dt); autoSwitch();\n    if (!golden && half === 1 && clock >= HALF) { half = 2; mode = 'half'; kickT = 2.4; restartBy = 1; owner = null; A.sfx('whistle'); say('HALF TIME: GULLS ' + score[0] + ', RUST ' + score[1] + '.'); }\n    else if (!golden && clock >= HALF * 2) {\n      if (score[0] === score[1]) { golden = true; clock = HALF * 2; A.sfx('whistle'); say('LEVEL AT FULL TIME: GOLDEN GOAL! THE NEXT ONE WINS IT.'); kickoff(0); }\n      else fullTime();\n    } else if (golden && clock >= HALF * 2 + GOLDEN) fullTime();\n  }\n  function fullTime() {\n    mode = 'full'; over = true; owner = null; A.sfx('whistle'); after.i = 0;\n    const w = score[0] > score[1] ? 0 : score[1] > score[0] ? 1 : -1; for (const p of all) p.cheer = p.side === w ? 99 : 0;\n    say(w < 0 ? 'FULL TIME: A DRAW IN THE CAGE.' : 'FULL TIME! THE ' + TEAMS[w].name + ' WIN IT, ' + Math.max(...score) + ' - ' + Math.min(...score) + '.');\n    if (!scripted) A.music(w === 0 || vs ? 'victory' : null);\n  }\n\n  /* ---- DRAWING: the cage, the posts, the players, the ball and its shadow; the score, the clock, the meter, the radar ---- */\n  function draw(r) {\n    if (mode === 'menu' || mode === 'join') return drawMenu(r);\n    const view = E.charView(r.view);\n    map.drawFloor(r); map.queueWalls(r);\n    for (const f of CROWD) {   // (cheering on the scoring side's goal, else a sway)\n      const up = mode === 'goal' && stats.goals.length && stats.goals[stats.goals.length - 1][0] === f.side ? Math.abs(Math.sin(t * 9 + f.ph)) * 5 : Math.sin(t * 2 + f.ph) * .6;\n      r.queue(f.x, f.y, f.z + up, g => { const [x, y] = r.w(f.x, f.y, f.z + up), X = Math.round(x), Y = Math.round(y); px.rect(g, X - 2, Y - 5, 4, 5, f.shirt); px.rect(g, X - 1, Y - 8, 3, 3, f.skin); });\n    }\n    for (const gx of [X0, X1]) for (const py of [CY - GH, CY + GH]) r.queue(gx, py, 0, g => { const [x, y] = r.w(gx, py, 0), [, y1] = r.w(gx, py, BAR); px.rect(g, Math.round(x) - 1, Math.round(y1), 2, Math.round(y - y1), '#f4f4f0'); });\n    for (const gx of [X0, X1]) r.queue(gx, CY + GH, BAR, g => { const [x0, y0] = r.w(gx, CY - GH, BAR), [x1, y1] = r.w(gx, CY + GH, BAR); px.line(g, Math.round(x0), Math.round(y0), Math.round(x1), Math.round(y1), '#f4f4f0', 2); }, { bias: 1 });\n    for (const p of all) {\n      const b = p.body; r.shadow(b.x, b.y, 6, .35);\n      r.actor(b.x, b.y, b.z, (g, ox, oy) => p.rig.draw(g, ox, oy, view));\n      if (p.input) r.queue(b.x, b.y, 40, g => { const [x, y] = r.w(b.x, b.y, 40), c = E.PLAYER_COLORS[p.input.player || 0] || '#ffe08a'; px.poly(g, [[x - 3, y - 4], [x + 3, y - 4], [x, y]], c); }, { emissive: true });\n      if (p.charging) r.queue(b.x, b.y, 44, g => { const [x, y] = r.w(b.x, b.y, 44); E.ui.bar(g, Math.round(x) - 10, Math.round(y) - 6, 20, 4, p.meter, p.meter > .8 ? '#ff6a3a' : '#ffd36a'); });\n    }\n    r.shadow(ball.x, ball.y, 3 - Math.min(1.5, ball.z * .05), .4);\n    r.sprite(ball.x, ball.y, ball.z + 2.5, Math.floor(ball.roll / 8) % 2 ? BALL2 : BALL, { anchor: 'center' });\n    r.overlay(g => hud(g, r));\n    talk.draw(r);\n    if (mode === 'full') { r.overlay(g => results(g, r)); after.draw(r); }\n  }\n  const mmss = s => Math.floor(s / 60) + ':' + String(Math.floor(s % 60)).padStart(2, '0');\n  function hud(g, r) {\n    // the score bug: the sides' chips and scores, the clock (counting down each half; golden goal says so)\n    const left = golden ? 'GOLDEN GOAL' : (half === 1 ? '1ST ' : '2ND ') + mmss(Math.max(0, HALF * half - clock));\n    E.ui.box(g, 4, 4, 132, 16, { bg: '#141826', border: '#6a7090', alpha: .85 });\n    px.rect(g, 8, 9, 6, 6, TEAMS[0].chip); px.rect(g, 70, 9, 6, 6, TEAMS[1].chip);\n    E.font.text(g, TEAMS[0].name + ' ' + score[0], 17, 8, '#f0ecdc', { font: 'tiny', outline: false });\n    E.font.text(g, score[1] + ' ' + TEAMS[1].name, 79, 8, '#f0ecdc', { font: 'tiny', outline: false });\n    E.font.text(g, left, 4, 24, golden ? '#ffd36a' : '#c8d0e8', { font: 'tiny', outline: '#000' });\n    // the radar: the cage small, the players as their colors, the ball white\n    const s = 2.4 / T, w = Math.round((X1 - X0) * s), h = Math.round((Y1 - Y0) * s), x0 = r.W - w - 6, ca = game.cornerArea(), y0 = ca && ca.x0 < x0 + w ? Math.ceil(ca.y1) + 4 : 26;   // (top right, under the corner's buttons or a kit's API button: the radio and the touch buttons have the bottom)\n    E.ui.box(g, x0 - 2, y0 - 2, w + 4, h + 4, { bg: '#183a1e', border: '#6a9070', alpha: .75 });\n    for (const p of all) px.rect(g, Math.round(x0 + (p.body.x - X0) * s) - 1, Math.round(y0 + (p.body.y - Y0) * s) - 1, 2, 2, TEAMS[p.side].chip);\n    px.rect(g, Math.round(x0 + (ball.x - X0) * s), Math.round(y0 + (ball.y - Y0) * s), 1, 1, '#ffffff');\n    if (mode === 'kickoff') E.font.text(g, 'KICK OFF', r.W / 2, r.H * .3, '#ffe7a8', { align: 'center', scale: 2, shadow: '#000', outline: false });\n    if (mode === 'goal') E.font.title(g, 'GOAL!', r.W / 2, r.H * .28, { align: 'center', scale: 4, colors: ['#fffbe8', '#ffe08a', '#ffb347'] });\n    if (mode === 'half') E.font.text(g, 'HALF TIME', r.W / 2, r.H * .3, '#ffe7a8', { align: 'center', scale: 2, shadow: '#000', outline: false });\n  }\n  function results(g, r) {\n    const w = score[0] > score[1] ? 0 : score[1] > score[0] ? 1 : -1;\n    E.ui.box(g, r.W / 2 - 110, 52, 220, 128, { bg: '#141826', border: '#e8c070', alpha: .92 });\n    E.font.title(g, w < 0 ? 'A DRAW' : TEAMS[w].name + ' WIN', r.W / 2, 60, { align: 'center', scale: 2, colors: ['#fffbe8', '#ffe08a', '#ffb347'] });\n    E.font.text(g, 'GULLS ' + score[0] + ' - ' + score[1] + ' RUST', r.W / 2, 86, '#f0ecdc', { align: 'center', outline: false });\n    stats.goals.slice(-5).forEach(([s, name, at], i) => E.font.text(g, mmss(at) + '  ' + name + ' (' + TEAMS[s].name + ')', r.W / 2, 100 + i * 9, '#c8d0e8', { align: 'center', font: 'tiny', outline: false }));\n  }\n  function drawMenu(r) {\n    r.sky(['#0e1630', '#1e3050', '#2e5a3a']);\n    r.overlay(g => {\n      E.font.title(g, 'CAGE CUP', r.W / 2, 34, { align: 'center', scale: 3, colors: ['#fffbe8', '#ffe08a', '#ffb347', '#e0662a'], depth: 2 });\n      E.font.text(g, 'TWO AGAINST TWO, UP TO FOUR PLAYERS', r.W / 2, 70, '#c8d0e8', { align: 'center', outline: false });\n      if (mode === 'join') {\n        const P = game.players;\n        E.font.text(g, 'VERSUS: PRESS 2 ON THE KEYBOARD, OR START ON A PAD, TO JOIN', r.W / 2, 96, '#ffe7a8', { align: 'center', font: 'tiny', outline: false });\n        ['P1 GULLS', 'P2 RUST', 'P3 GULLS', 'P4 RUST'].forEach((s, i) => E.font.text(g, s + (P[i] ? '  READY' : '  ...'), r.W / 2 - 40, 112 + i * 12, P[i] ? E.PLAYER_COLORS[i] : '#6a7090', { outline: false }));\n        E.font.text(g, prompt('confirm', 'PLAY') + '   ' + prompt('cancel', 'BACK'), r.W / 2, 172, '#c8d0e8', { align: 'center', font: 'tiny', outline: false });\n      }\n    });\n    if (mode === 'menu') menu.draw(r);\n  }\n\n  /* ---- THE CONTROLS: the default preset's stick with three buttons of its own ---- */\n  const KEYS = Object.assign({}, E.Input.DEFAULT, { pass: ['KeyJ', 'KeyX', 'Pad0'], shoot: ['KeyK', 'KeyZ', 'Pad2'], lob: ['KeyL', 'KeyC', 'Pad3'] });\n  for (const k of ['attack', 'dash', 'skill', 'jump']) delete KEYS[k];\n\n  /** the proof: a match from the kickoff, player 1 running at goal, passing, lobbing, shooting; a hash of the match */\n  const run = (n = 600) => proof('sports', n, (i, k) => {\n    if (i === 1) start(false);\n    if (i === 140) k.hold('right'); if (i === 200) k.tap('pass'); if (i === 300) k.tap('lob');\n    if (i === 380) k.hold('shoot'); if (i === 440) k.up('shoot'); if (i === 520) k.up('right');\n  }, () => [Math.round(ball.x), Math.round(ball.y), Math.round(ball.z), score, all.map(p => [Math.round(p.body.x), Math.round(p.body.y)]), stats.passes, stats.shots, owner ? owner.name : null]);\n  /** the bot: player 1 plays a match by the game's own rules (the stick and the buttons, as a player gives them, from the\n   *  CPU's own judgment for its player) to the final whistle; then four players, each holding one footballer, for a\n   *  stretch. Returns { full, score, goals, passes, done, lobs, shots, curled, tackles, four, seconds, errors } */\n  function bot(s = 1) {\n    const was = Math.random; Math.random = E.rng(s); const I = game.input, held = new Set(), hold = (a, on) => { if (on && !held.has(a)) { held.add(a); I.hold(a); } else if (!on && held.has(a)) { held.delete(a); I.hold(a, false); } };\n    scripted = true;\n    try {\n      game.go('sports', null, { fade: 0 }); game.advance(1 / 120); start(false);\n      let n = 0;\n      for (; n < 120 * 400 && mode !== 'full'; n++) {\n        const me = team[0].find(p => p.input);\n        if (me && mode === 'play') {\n          const c = brain(me, 1 / 120), mv = curlT > 0 && last === me && !owner ? [0, 0] : c.move;   // what the CPU would do in its place, given as the stick and buttons (still while its shot flies: no curl)\n          hold('right', mv[0] > .35); hold('left', mv[0] < -.35); hold('down', mv[1] > .35); hold('up', mv[1] < -.35);\n          if (c.pass) I.tap('pass'); if (c.lob) I.tap('lob'); hold('shoot', c.shootHeld);\n        } else for (const a of ['right', 'left', 'up', 'down', 'shoot']) hold(a, false);\n        game.advance(1 / 120);\n      }\n      for (const a of [...held]) hold(a, false);\n      const r = { full: mode === 'full', score: score.slice(), goals: stats.goals.length, passes: stats.passes, done: stats.done, lobs: stats.lobs, shots: stats.shots, curled: stats.curled, tackles: stats.tackles, walls: stats.walls, seconds: Math.round(n / 120) };\n      // four players: three more join, each footballer held by an input; a stretch of play, each pushing its stick\n","numLines":404,"startLine":1,"totalLines":404}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018LAgcafrtCbvirS1cX6QTi","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
