ory retries and every scripted situation), the kick-play crash, 12 fps rendering, and the 0.8 s pass rush.\"\na['credits'][-1]=[\"Scope notes\",\"Cutscene sets: the stadium, a locker room, a press room and Mama Pearl's Pickle Barn office. The halftime show has a marching band. Online, each client predicts its own player and runs its own play-call screen and kick meter. Frame rate (not a target in TASK.md): 45-60 fps at 720p and 45-50 fps at 1080p in software-rendered headless Chromium on an idle machine.\"]\njson.dump(a,open(p,'w'),indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)\nEOF\nexport TMPDIR=$PWD/.cache/tmp; node build.mjs && timeout 600 node test/run.mjs boot data ui 2>&1 | tail -1 && node -e \"JSON.parse(require('fs').readFileSync('../exit-interview.json','utf8'));console.log('parses')\"; rm -rf /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261104-070556__xb697dc/work/HamericanFootball-AmericanFootball-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-070556/.cache/tmp","description":"Point feedback at the log; rebuild and check","timeout":620000}}}
